    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="77.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Abt">Abt</ref> 77.1</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="77.1" corresp="#wit-h">Gif hit þonne facne is, ef þær æt ham gebrenge, ⁊ him man his scæt agefe.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#oliver" n="76.1" corresp="#wit-h">Gif hit þonne facne is, ef[t] þær æt ham gebrenge, ⁊ him man his scæt agefe.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#oliver">If there is deception, afterwards let him bring [her to her] home, and let him be given his money.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#attenborough">If however there is dishonesty, she shall be taken back to her home, and the money shall be returned to him.</ab>
      </div>
